    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This delightful family home represents the unique opportunity chance to secure the a brand new, four-bedroom family home in Luttrellstown Gate.\r\n\r\nLuttrellstown Gate is a brand-new development of 3 and 4 bedroom homes delivered by the award winning Castlethorn, widely regarded for their exceptional quality and workmanship.\r\n\r\nSet out over two floors, this stunning home extends to approx. 129 sqm (1,389 sqft) and comprises of a welcoming entrance hall with Guest W.C. and access to a generous living room complete with feature corner window and double doors opening through to the kitchen/ dining area with utility. The ground floor is completed to the rear with a family room allowing for double door access to the rear garden. At the first floor level are four large bedrooms, to include a master bedroom with ensuite, and a family bathroom. \r\n\r\nLuttrellstown Gate is situated adjacent to Luttrellstown Castle Estate and just minutes from Dublin’s Phoenix Park. The development is immersed in natural amenities in this idyllic setting, without compromising on access to Dublin 15’s extensive and varied facilities. From the picturesque Phoenix Park and Strawberry Beds to the various GAA, Rugby, Soccer and Golf Clubs nearby, Dublin 15 has something for everyone. \r\n\r\nWith excellent transport links to Dublin City Centre and beyond just moments from the development, Luttrellstown Gate is the perfect location for those looking to stay connected to the city without the hustle and bustle of an urban setting. With easy access to the M50 and situated just a short stroll from Coolmine train station and Dublin Bus services, Luttrellstown Gate offers residents convenient connectivity across Dublin and further afield.\r\n\r\nDublin 15 benefits from an excellent variety of retail and restaurants, from Blanchardstown Shopping Centre just a few minutes away to the Wren’s Nest and Goats Gruff nestled in the nearby Strawberry Beds. For families, Dublin 15 offers an array of options for both primary and secondary schools right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFirst established over 30 years ago, Castlethorn have since delivered thousands of homes across Ireland making them an industry leader at the forefront of new homes development. Castlethorn also have a long track record of delivering high quality homes locally, including many ever-popular developments such as Riverwood, St. Josephs and more recently, Rathborne in Ashtown."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "* Brand-new semi-detached family home\r\n* Approx. 129 sq.m / 1,389 sq.ft \r\n* Firebird air source heat pump with 24/7 programmable heating controls\r\n* Two designated parking spaces\r\n* Spacious master bedroom with en-suite \r\n* Contemporary, high-quality specification throughout\r\n* Generous rear garden"
      },
